@Notes for developers: use `GetListingStatus` to check for a listing by ID
@Note by script writers: use `Setlistingstatus` to change the status of a listing in this script
Use: This script brings up information about a Listing when you double click on it. It also has a feature that updates a property of a listing by editing that property in the GUI, or by changing the value of a variable in a text block.
Right click on any list entry. Choose "Listing Detail" in the menu that appears. The menu will expand and include a list box full of listing details. You can then expand those items as much as you wish to see detailed information. When you start double clicking on something to get more info, you'll want a "split window." Do that at the top left, right above the program icon. That way you can view all open stuff in a single screen without having to go back to different windows, which is tedious.
